 constellation Canis Major. P␀ Chandra X-ray Observatory Centern␀NASA/SAO/CXCs␀Chandra X-ray Observatory7␀20000926␀Sirius A & Bt␀/http://chandra.harvard.edu/photo/image_use.html8BIM%␀␀␀␀␀_ä²ƒª5f¿æó¨ÿ8BIMê␀␀␀␀<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
